{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c419","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a14b74-03fb-7d03-878f-dfaf07bafb31"},"sequence":103,"recorded_at":1780531400000201,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a14b74-0c73-7f61-b488-8792254708ab","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"01a14b74-0c73-7f61-b488-8792254708ab","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"01a14b74-0c73-7f61-b488-8792254708ab"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a14b74-95c8-73e3-bfc5-4989345f7f72"},"task_id":"01a14b74-95c8-73e3-bfc5-4989345f7f72","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a14b74-95c8-73e3-bfc5-4989345f7f72","chunk":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-3-1\",\n  \"command\": \"cd /Users/aazhiry1/work/src/cli-agent-bridge && grep -n \\\"validate_turn_id\\\\|_TURN_ID_RE\\\\|GAP_DETECTED\\\\|GapDetected\\\\|DETACHED_ORPHAN_TTL\\\\|MAX.*10\\\\|10 \\\\* 1024\\\\|10485760\\\" core/turn_session_manager.py | head -n 60; echo ---WATCHDOG---; grep -n \\\"fail\\\\|ps\\\\|cputime\\\\|300\\\\|3600\\\\|Lock\\\\|close\\\" core/watchdog.py | head -n 80; echo ---LIFECYCLE---; grep -n \\\"orphan\\\\|reap\\\\|300\\\\|drain\\\\|110\\\\|Event\\\\|Lock\\\" core/lifecycle.py | head -n 60\",\n  \"description\": \"Grep key mechanisms skeptic\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"10:- Кольцевой буфер `TurnBuffer` ограничен `MAX_TURN_TEXT_BYTES = 10 МиБ` на ход и\\n13:  (`from_seq < oldest_available_seq - 1`) порождает `GapDetectedError` для ответа\\n14:  `HTTP 410 Gone` (`code=\\\"GAP_DETECTED\\\"`, RW-006).\\n54:MAX_TURN_TEXT_BYTES: int = 10 * 1024 * 1024\\n56:MAX_TURN_BUFFER_TOTAL_BYTES: int = 128 * 1024 * 1024\\n93:def validate_turn_id(turn_id: Any) -> bool:\\n212:class GapDetectedError(Exception):\\n226:            f\\\"GAP_DETECTED turn_id={turn_id} requested_from_seq={requested_from_seq} \\\"\\n247:                \\\"code\\\": \\\"GAP_DETECTED\\\",\\n400:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Кольцевой буфер событий одного хода с лимитом `MAX_TURN_TEXT_BYTES` (10 МиБ).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n587:                raise GapDetectedError(\\n604:        \\\"\\\"\\\"Возвращает события с `seq > from_seq` или выбрасывает `GapDetectedError` (410).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n1093:        if not validate_turn_id(turn_id):\\n1114:        if not validate_turn_id(turn_id):\\n1168:            if not validate_turn_id(resume_turn_id):\\n1180:            if not validate_turn_id(requested_turn_id):\\n---WATCHDOG---\\n5:1. Контур активности (`IDLE_TIMEOUT_S = 300.0` с): таймер неактивности сбрасывается\\n7:   положительного прироста процессорного времени (`cputime` delta > 0) в группе `pgid`,\\n10:2. Предохранительный потолок (`SAFETY_CAP_S = 3600.0` с, `FINISH_RESERVE_S = 35.0` с):\\n13:При деградации/таймауте вызова `ps` применяется политика fail-closed: событие\\n14:фиксируется в логе (`watchdog_ps_degraded`), а `last_activity_ts` не обновляется.\\n27:IDLE_TIMEOUT_S: float = 300.0\\n28:SAFETY_CAP_S: float = 3600.0\\n43:def parse_cputime(raw: str) -> float:\\n44:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Разбирает поле `cputime` вывода `ps` (`[[dd-]hh:]mm:ss[.xx]`) в секунды.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n87:    ps_degraded: bool = False\\n93:        if self.ps_degraded or not self.alive:\\n101:    \\\"\\\"\\\"Мониторинг процессной группы `pgid` на macOS/POSIX через `os.killpg` и `ps`.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n105:        ps_timeout_s: float = PS_TIMEOUT_S,\\n110:        self.ps_timeout_s = float(ps_timeout_s)\\n114:        self._lock = threading.Lock()\\n148:    def _run_ps(self, pgid: int) -> subprocess.CompletedProcess[str]:\\n150:            [\\\"ps\\\", \\\"-o\\\", \\\"pid=,ppid=,pgid=,stat=,cputime=,command=\\\", \\\"-g\\\", str(pgid)],\\n153:            timeout=self.ps_timeout_s,\\n157:    def _parse_ps_output(\\n180:            cputime_str = match.group(5) or \\\"\\\"\\n184:            cpu_by_pid[pid] = parse_cputime(cputime_str)\\n193:        \\\"\\\"\\\"Фиксирует базовый срез PID и cputime группы при старте хода без сброса таймера.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n205:        \\\"\\\"\\\"Опрашивает группу `pgid` и вычисляет прирост `cputime` и новых потомков.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n217:                ps_degraded=False,\\n222:            proc = self._run_ps(pgid)\\n232:                    ps_degraded=False,\\n236:                f\\\"watchdog_ps_degraded rid={eff_rid} turn_id={eff_turn} \\\"\\n246:                ps_degraded=True,\\n259:                    ps_degraded=False,\\n263:                f\\\"watchdog_ps_degraded rid={eff_rid} turn_id={eff_turn} \\\"\\n273:                ps_degraded=True,\\n277:        descendants, cpu_s, any_alive = self._parse_ps_output(proc.stdout, pgid)\\n286:                ps_degraded=False,\\n306:                    ps_degraded=False,\\n327:            ps_degraded=False,\\n358:        self._lock = threading.Lock()\\n437:            idle_elapsed = now - self.last_activity_ts\\n438:            if idle_elapsed >= self.idle_timeout_s:\\n444:    def close(self) -> None:\\n---LIFECYCLE---\\n5:   только `threading.Event` (`shutdown_requested`), не захватывая мьютексы и не\\n7:2. Координацию `DRAINING` в фоновом потоке (`DRAIN_TIMEOUT_S = 110.0` с при\\n11:   прерываются со сбросом `reasoning_content` и терминальным чанком `drain_timeout`.\\n12:3. Безопасную уборку сирот при старте (`reap_orphans_on_startup`, `RW-004`): сверка\\n14:   мягкое погашение `SIGTERM -> 1s -> SIGKILL` с логом `orphan_reaped`.\\n36:DRAIN_TIMEOUT_S: float = 110.0\\n124:        drain_timeout_s: float = DRAIN_TIMEOUT_S,\\n126:        orphan_grace_s: float = ORPHAN_SIGTERM_GRACE_S,\\n127:        drain_enabled_fn: Callable[[], bool] | None = None,\\n140:        self.drain_timeout_s = float(drain_timeout_s)\\n142:        self.orphan_grace_s = float(orphan_grace_s)\\n143:        self._drain_enabled_fn = drain_enabled_fn or (\\n156:        self.shutdown_requested = threading.Event()\\n157:        self.drain_started = threading.Event()\\n158:        self.drain_completed = threading.Event()\\n162:        self._lock = threading.Lock()\\n164:        self._drain_thread: threading.Thread | None = None\\n185:    def is_draining(self) -> bool:\\n191:    def is_drain_enabled(self) -> bool:\\n192:        return bool(self._drain_enabled_fn())\\n202:        \\\"\\\"\\\"Привязывает экземпляр `ThreadingHTTPServer` для остановки после drain.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n207:        \\\"\\\"\\\"Привязывает HTTP-сервер и запускает фоновый поток координации drain.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n210:        return self.start_drain_worker()\\n215:        В обработчике сигнала запрещены захват `Lock`, логирование и I/O:\\n216:        выставляется только атомарный `threading.Event`.\\n221:    def start_drain_worker(self) -> threading.Thread:\\n224:            if self._drain_thread is not None and self._drain_thread.is_alive():\\n225:                return self._drain_thread\\n227:                target=self._drain_worker_loop,\\n228:                name=\\\"hub-drain-coordinator\\\",\\n231:            self._drain_thread = worker\\n236:        \\\"\\\"\\\"Регистрирует `handle_signal` для `SIGTERM`/`SIGINT` и запускает drain-поток.\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n238:            self.start_drain_worker()\\n245:        self.start_drain_worker()\\n248:    def _drain_worker_loop(self) -> None:\\n250:        self.run_drain_once()\\n252:    def run_drain_once(self) -> dict[str, Any]:\\n258:            self.drain_started.set()\\n261:        eff_timeout = self.drain_timeout_s if self.is_drain_enabled() else 0.0\\n268:            f\\\"drain_started signal={self.last_signal or 0} \\\"\\n282:                    f\\\"drain_timeout_interrupt rid={turn.rid} turn_id={turn.turn_id} \\\"\\n285:                self.turn_manager.interrupt_for_drain(\\n287:                    message=\\\"bridge restart drain timeout exceeded\\\",\\n307:            self.drain_completed.set()\\n308:        self._log(f\\\"drain_completed interrupted_turns={len(remaining)}\\\")\\n314:    def draining_response(self) -> tuple[int, dict[str, str], dict[str, Any]]:\\n322:                \\\"message\\\": \\\"bridge is draining for restart\\\",\\n331:        if self.is_draining():\\n382:    def reap_orphans_on_startup(\\n417:        reaped_pgids: list[int] = []\\n441:            deadline = time.monotonic() + max(0.05, self.orphan_grace_s)\\n457:            reaped_pgids.append(pgid)\\n458:            self._log(f\\\"orphan_reaped pgid={pgid} turn_id={turn_id}\\\")\\n470:        return reaped_pgids\\n472:    reap_startup_orphans = reap_orphans_on_startup\\n478:            self.drain_started.clear()\\n479:            self.drain_completed.clear()\\n482:            self._drain_thread = None\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 7529,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 1883,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","final_result":true}}}
